  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy policy",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated: October 23, 2026",
  "privacyIntro": "PixelHub is an offline-first pixel-coloring game. Coins and painting unlocks are virtual and never require real money; online accounts, advertising and in-app payments are not active.",
  "privacyPhotos": "If you select a photo, it is processed on your device. The original image and location metadata are not sent to our servers or saved by PixelHub. Only the resulting pixel-art level may be stored locally.",
