  "privacyRemote": "PixelHub currently has no advertising SDK, online payments or remote crash-reporting service. Technical error and usage counts are kept in memory for the current session only and are not uploaded.",
  "privacyDelete": "You can delete locally saved game data from Settings > Clear local data, or remove the app and its data. Deletion cannot undo a file you shared with another service.",
